				Time="2011-12-05T12:27:31" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アララギ『おお！
おまえさんも　来たのかい▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-05T12:27:31" />
