	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d08r0101_hakase1_03b"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>……２ねんまえ▼
この　とうで　ひとりの　おとこと
１ぴきの　ポケモンが　むきあった▼
その　おとこは　せかいを　かえようと
りそうを　おいもとめていた▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-05T12:27:31" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-05T12:27:31" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>２年前▼
この塔で　一人の　男と
１匹の　ポケモンが　向き合った▼
その男は　世界を　変えようと
理想を　追い求めていた▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-05T12:27:31" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-05T12:27:31" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：Black2ver
・再度上を向いてメッセージ表示
・続けてhakase1_04b</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T13:20:03" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>HAKASE1
アララギ博士父</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-05T12:27:31" />
		</AttributeCell>
